  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Thoughtfully ordering orange juice for Chun Yuqiao's weak stomach, Xin Huimei realises she misjudged him—and Chun Yuqiao explains why he trusts her character completely. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "知道你胃不好不能喝酒，橙汁可以吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看来你还在调查我的真相。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是那么八卦的女人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你只是一个简单的女孩。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这么有把握？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不会看错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "为什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "因为你特别聪明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "因为我曾经很傻。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "知道你胃不好不能喝酒，橙汁可以吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know your stomach is delicate and you cannot drink alcohol—is orange juice alright?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "看来你还在调查我的真相。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It seems you have still been looking into the truth about me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我是那么八卦的女人吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do I look like such a gossipy woman?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你只是一个简单的女孩。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are simply a straightforward girl.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这么有把握？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are that confident?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不会看错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not misread people.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "为什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "因为你特别聪明。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because you are remarkably sharp.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "因为我曾经很傻。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because I used to be very foolish.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
